          "contents": "# Required testing \ntest_username = \"trailblazer\"\ntest_password = \"trailblazer\"\n# Write your rules below, using test_username and test_password\n\n\n# --- Now build your Password Checker ---\n# Never use a real password here -- make up fake credentials for testing!\nusername = input(\"Choose a username: \")\npassword = input(\"Choose a password: \")\n\n# Write your rules again below, using username and password",
